lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+h-{y}^{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{y}^{2})}{h}).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-25a45b6b-9452-510a-88d9-fa6cff3a05a6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-25a45b6b-9452-510a-88d9-fa6cff3a05a6" :answer-field/id #uuid "25a45b6b-9452-510a-88d9-fa6cff3a05a6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-04fd8c41-938d-5896-af76-a08ef933364a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3cd25198-8ccd-5ecb-ab36-bbba0fbb0d6d" "answer-04fd8c41-938d-5896-af76-a08ef933364a" "answer-642b4c1b-1346-5ee7-abed-a5e7648fbb56" "answer-14ea137a-7846-516f-9915-09b5b41d82fc" "answer-959569af-b23a-5e0d-8446-2bab69573083"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3cd25198-8ccd-5ecb-ab36-bbba0fbb0d6d" :answer/id #uuid "3cd25198-8ccd-5ecb-ab36-bbba0fbb0d6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+h-{y}^{2})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{y}^{2})}{h})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-04fd8c41-938d-5896-af76-a08ef933364a" :answer/id #uuid "04fd8c41-938d-5896-af76-a08ef933364a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+h-{y}^{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{y}^{2})}{h})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-642b4c1b-1346-5ee7-abed-a5e7648fbb56" :answer/id #uuid "642b4c1b-1346-5ee7-abed-a5e7648fbb56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xh-{y}^{2})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{y}^{2})}{h})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-14ea137a-7846-516f-9915-09b5b41d82fc" :answer/id #uuid "14ea137a-7846-516f-9915-09b5b41d82fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(xh-{y}^{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{y}^{2})}{h})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-959569af-b23a-5e0d-8446-2bab69573083" :answer/id #uuid "959569af-b23a-5e0d-8446-2bab69573083" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{h\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{y}^{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{y}^{2})}{h})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-fab082ec-08e1-574d-8102-367e3c718114" :question/id #uuid "fab082ec-08e1-574d-8102-367e3c718114" :question/math-academy-id "q-159572" :question/problem "Given that $f(x,y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy),$ then $\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=$" :question/worked-solution "The partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $x$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}={lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{f(x+h,y)-f(x,y)}{h}).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy),$  we have that \n\n$$\nf(x+h,y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡((x+h)y).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}={lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡((x+h)y)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)}{h}).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-fb776df8-d18c-56c6-b0af-71e18ee9b2ff"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-fb776df8-d18c-56c6-b0af-71e18ee9b2ff" :answer-field/id #uuid "fb776df8-d18c-56c6-b0af-71e18ee9b2ff" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-dd8fe9b0-2dfe-5cce-8bde-270fb503d4de" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0966d4fd-1004-5375-90cf-1757ff705f99" "answer-dd8fe9b0-2dfe-5cce-8bde-270fb503d4de" "answer-e34026d0-8c07-5e65-85c3-9dc96c50dbd3" "answer-b4733487-8f20-5482-b97a-b62fc0d6cb76" "answer-6c6f24d2-f9ef-5de6-894b-96a6e11cae68"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0966d4fd-1004-5375-90cf-1757ff705f99" :answer/id #uuid "0966d4fd-1004-5375-90cf-1757ff705f99" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡((x+h)(y+h))-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)}{h})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dd8fe9b0-2dfe-5cce-8bde-270fb503d4de" :answer/id #uuid "dd8fe9b0-2dfe-5cce-8bde-270fb503d4de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡((x+h)y)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)}{h})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e34026d0-8c07-5e65-85c3-9dc96c50dbd3" :answer/id #uuid "e34026d0-8c07-5e65-85c3-9dc96c50dbd3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x(y+h))-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)}{h})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b4733487-8f20-5482-b97a-b62fc0d6cb76" :answer/id #uuid "b4733487-8f20-5482-b97a-b62fc0d6cb76" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy+h)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)}{h})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6c6f24d2-f9ef-5de6-894b-96a6e11cae68" :answer/id #uuid "6c6f24d2-f9ef-5de6-894b-96a6e11cae68" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{lim}_{h\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy+h)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(xy)}{h})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-ca64fedb-1539-5dab-a00d-8a624f81d8c4" :question/id #uuid "ca64fedb-1539-5dab-a00d-8a624f81d8c4" :question/math-academy-id "q-159612" :question/problem "Find $\\frac{∂f}{∂y}$ given that $f(x,y)=3\\operatorname{arctan}⁡y-x{y}^{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "We differentiate the given function with respect to $y,$ treating all other variables as constants.\n\nAdditionally, we use the sum and constant multiple rules for differentiation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3\\operatorname{arctan}⁡y-x{y}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3\\operatorname{arctan}⁡y)-\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x{y}^{2}) \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡y)-x\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}({y}^{2}) \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{1}{1+{y}^{2}}-x\\cdot 2y \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{1+{y}^{2}}-2xy\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1ad15885-4f52-5353-a9a6-c3dae29fe5c9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1ad15885-4f52-5353-a9a6-c3dae29fe5c9" :answer-field/id #uuid "1ad15885-4f52-5353-a9a6-c3dae29fe5c9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ab9e0b79-350f-56ca-97e1-d432fc67e8d3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-5347b519-c490-5531-86d9-c47823454ef5" "answer-55c2293e-6cda-5e44-a3be-cf42f0b0106e" "answer-ab9e0b79-350f-56ca-97e1-d432fc67e8d3" "answer-a2853c1d-4c78-58f1-877e-d34353665049" "answer-6d40833e-3b6e-5b26-96b6-154dbe238c17"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5347b519-c490-5531-86d9-c47823454ef5" :answer/id #uuid "5347b519-c490-5531-86d9-c47823454ef5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{y}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-55c2293e-6cda-5e44-a3be-cf42f0b0106e" :answer/id #uuid "55c2293e-6cda-5e44-a3be-cf42f0b0106e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{arctan}⁡y-{y}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ab9e0b79-350f-56ca-97e1-d432fc67e8d3" :answer/id #uuid "ab9e0b79-350f-56ca-97e1-d432fc67e8d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{1+{y}^{2}}-2xy" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a2853c1d-4c78-58f1-877e-d34353665049" :answer/id #uuid "a2853c1d-4c78-58f1-877e-d34353665049" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{1+{y}^{2}}-{y}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6d40833e-3b6e-5b26-96b6-154dbe238c17" :answer/id #uuid "6d40833e-3b6e-5b26-96b6-154dbe238c17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{6xy}{1+{y}^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-7ea23849-68e0-52dc-ba91-b8da7ebd925a" :question/id #uuid "7ea23849-68e0-52dc-ba91-b8da7ebd925a" :question/math-academy-id "q-159624" :question/problem "Find ${f}_{y}(x,y)$ for $f(x,y)=x{e}^{y}+y{e}^{x}.$" :question/worked-solution "The notation ${f}_{y}$ denotes the partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $y.$\n\nWe differentiate the given function with respect to $y,$ treating all other variables as constants.\n\nAdditionally, we use the sum and constant multiple rules for differentiation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{y}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x{e}^{y}+y{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x{e}^{y})+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(y{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =x\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}({e}^{y})+{e}^{x}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂y}(y) \\\\  & =x\\cdot {e}^{y}+{e}^{x}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =x{e}^{y}+{e}^{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ec0f419d-2a0d-5de9-af19-f4de7b215052"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ec0f419d-2a0d-5de9-af19-f4de7b215052" :answer-field/id #uuid "ec0f419d-2a0d-5de9-af19-f4de7b215052" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-21514dc3-fd5d-565c-a5dd-41b334024de1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-21514dc3-fd5d-565c-a5dd-41b334024de1" "answer-ffa0af21-05d8-5b41-b926-c8615ac23faf" "answer-9023fe86-f4d4-53cf-afa7-ceab284c385c" "answer-a479ae38-298e-5258-8558-f1d904df696f" "answer-e1294690-bb34-5896-b0c1-f42f98fe8355"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-21514dc3-fd5d-565c-a5dd-41b334024de1" :answer/id #uuid "21514dc3-fd5d-565c-a5dd-41b334024de1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x{e}^{y}+{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ffa0af21-05d8-5b41-b926-c8615ac23faf" :answer/id #uuid "ffa0af21-05d8-5b41-b926-c8615ac23faf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9023fe86-f4d4-53cf-afa7-ceab284c385c" :answer/id #uuid "9023fe86-f4d4-53cf-afa7-ceab284c385c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{y}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a479ae38-298e-5258-8558-f1d904df696f" :answer/id #uuid "a479ae38-298e-5258-8558-f1d904df696f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{y}+y{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e1294690-bb34-5896-b0c1-f42f98fe8355" :answer/id #uuid "e1294690-bb34-5896-b0c1-f42f98fe8355" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{y}+{e}^{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-90392678-f725-5c12-933c-87fa3256c47c" :question/id #uuid "90392678-f725-5c12-933c-87fa3256c47c" :question/math-academy-id "q-159609" :question/problem "For the function $f(x,y)=y\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-2{x}^{5}{e}^{y},$ evaluate ${f}_{x}(1,\\operatorname{ln}⁡3).$" :question/worked-solution "We differentiate the given function with respect to $x,$ treating all other variables as constants:\n\nAdditionally, we use the sum and constant multiple rules for differentiation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(y\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-2{x}^{5}{e}^{y}) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(y\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2{x}^{5}{e}^{y}) \\\\  & =y\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)-2{e}^{y}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{5}) \\\\  & =y\\cdot (\\frac{1}{x})-2{e}^{y}\\cdot (5{x}^{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{y}{x}-10{x}^{4}{e}^{y}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point $(1,\\operatorname{ln}⁡3):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{x}(1,\\operatorname{ln}⁡3) & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{1}-10\\cdot {1}^{4}\\cdot {e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-10\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-30\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-db764a00-316f-56d9-8f40-2a0441db7ae8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-db764a00-316f-56d9-8f40-2a0441db7ae8" :answer-field/id #uuid "db764a00-316f-56d9-8f40-2a0441db7ae8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-a2ff159b-22e8-5203-b53e-81a9138124a9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-58a19112-03ca-50b8-84a1-fe692ba95087" "answer-9e7a5161-9c2f-5c14-b85f-c8f0665e4971" "answer-e9c6a17e-95c5-56f6-8ecd-f1ad41f668be" "answer-a2ff159b-22e8-5203-b53e-81a9138124a9" "answer-60c0f614-7c90-5e8c-8d18-e07fc305806f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-58a19112-03ca-50b